      "text": "Use round billet stock of \u00d8133 mm by 48.7 mm, based on the \u00d8128.2 mm tooth-tip limit plus stock allowance and the 38.7 mm axial length stated in the supplied assumptions. These dimensions remain provisional because the graph envelope and gear-zone dimensions conflict."
